==============================================
To install LaTeX, you should:

 * run iniTeX on latex2e.ins, which produces the files that LaTeX needs,
  including latex2e.ltx.

 * run iniTeX on latex2e.ltx, which produces the LaTeX format.

 * put the files where LaTeX can read them.

